    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0432",
      "reading_order": 474,
      "section": "SWITCH PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 724.20873681,
        "r": 181.68660512590003,
        "b": 709.2828958877272
      },
      "content": "SWITCH PWA",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0433",
      "reading_order": 475,
      "section": "SWITCH PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 695.10277681,
        "r": 503.99162932610074,
        "b": 662.207704832033
      },
      "content": "The switch PWA (see Figure 9-14) contains the plunger translation position sensor, which is one of six position sensors in the system. The switch PWA is located at the side of the mechanism sub-chassis, and connects to the driver PWA."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0434",
      "reading_order": 476,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 639.19196,
        "r": 146.1607400666,
        "b": 610.2828958877272
      },
      "content": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0435",
      "reading_order": 477,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 71.99900399900002,
        "t": 596.10277681,
        "r": 503.94013607440075,
        "b": 575.2075248800329
      },
      "content": "The APP (air, pressure, and pin) PWA (see Figure 9-15) is  mounted in the mechanism sub-chassis. The APP PWA contains the following mechanism subsystem circuitry:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0436",
      "reading_order": 478,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 80.99896863510003,
        "t": 566.1031270899001,
        "r": 308.06070300850035,
        "b": 557.2076952079329
      },
      "content": "-Proximal and distal air sensors and circuitry"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0437",
      "reading_order": 479,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 80.99896863510003,
        "t": 548.7030892200002,
        "r": 390.25429113209964,
        "b": 539.807657338033
      },
      "content": "-Proximal and distal pressure sensor amplifiers and excitation"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0438",
      "reading_order": 480,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 80.99896863510003,
        "t": 531.2430920899002,
        "r": 246.9415000439002,
        "b": 522.347660207933
      },
      "content": "-V2_5 precision voltage reference"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0439",
      "reading_order": 481,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 80.99896863510003,
        "t": 513.7830949598002,
        "r": 258.18953853710013,
        "b": 504.88766307783294
      },
      "content": "-Pin detector optical switch module"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0440",
      "reading_order": 482,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 71.99920319920002,
        "t": 490.3830474658002,
        "r": 504.07449660930035,
        "b": 457.48797548783295
      },
      "content": "The APP PWA is a four layer board, with one ground plane, one power plane and two signal layers. The APP PWA uses SMT components, mounted on both sides of the board. The air sensors and the pin detector module are board mounted."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0441",
      "reading_order": 483,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 71.99920319920002,
        "t": 442.3836676737002,
        "r": 503.9344588687,
        "b": 421.48841574373296
      },
      "content": "See Section 4.2.3 for a functional description, and see Table 4-9 for APP PWA interface connections."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0021",
      "reading_order": 484,
      "section": "4.3.6 APP PWA",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 70.47059631347656,
        "t": 402.52197265625,
        "r": 505.0523681640625,
        "b": 321.3059387207031
      },
      "markdown": "| Table 4-9. APP PWA Interface Connections   | Table 4-9. APP PWA Interface Connections   | Table 4-9. APP PWA Interface Connections   |\n|--------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|\n| Connector                                  | Type                                       | Interface                                  |\n| J15                                        | 20 pin SMT                                 | Flat flex cable to driver PWA              |\n| J11                                        | 10 pin SMT                                 | Pressure sensor connector                  |"
    },
    {
